+// rather than straight to the FIFO, so the write filter sees them. As on the console, where they
+// write the FIFO directly, they leave the API's copy of the registers (GA) alone: GXSetVtxDesc and
+// GXSetVtxAttrFmt change fields of what the API itself last set, and with J3D's vertex formats in
